Hallo,

I think I've found a bug which causes panic in the game.
I play a wizard in nethack-- based on nethack3.1.3 on a atari,
but I think this is a fault in every system/version (sorry,
I have no time to check it out).

I go successfully through the quest, and finally anger the
wizard of ballance. He kick me out of the quest and delete
the magic portal in the dungeon. So their is no way back
to the quest. But wait, invoking the Eye of the Aethiopica
bring me back to the quest.
I found the angered wizard of ballance and he try to kick
me out another one. I got the Message:

panic: goto_level: no corresponding portal!

It's a message from the function goto_level() in do.c.

I think he will send me through the magic portal in the quest,
but he had removed the other portal in the dungeon.

In wizard mode I have the same effect. It's easy to reproduce.
Go to the quest, got the Eye of the Aethiopica. Anger the
wizard of balance. Invoke the Eye of the Aethiopica and go back
to the quest. Search for the wizard of ballance.

I hope thats enough to solve the problem in the next release.

